# Source checkpoint is staged by explicit whitelist, never git add .
*
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!README.md
!CURRENT-FEATURE-COVERAGE.md
!THIRD-PARTY.md
!LICENSE.MonsterOverlay.txt
!NOTICE.MonsterOverlay.txt
!src/
!src/**/
!src/**/*.cs
!src/**/*.csproj
!src/**/*.json
!src/**/*.tsv
!tools/
!tools/**/
!tools/**/*.cs
!tools/**/*.csproj
!tools/**/*.py
!tools/**/*.ps1
!tools/**/*.cmd
!release/
!release/third-party/
!release/third-party/*.txt
!research/
!research/monster-state/
!research/monster-state/*-20261027*.json
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/vendor/
**/__pycache__/
*.log
*.dpapi
**/config/
private/

# Never track binary dependencies or model assets, including under tools.
*.dll
*.exe
*.zip
*.7z
*.vrm
*.blend
*.blend1
*.pdb
*.mrl3
*.mod3
*.tex

**/saved-memories.json
**/memory.md
**/chat-history*
**/*secrets*.json
